{"unit_id":"deepforce__dsh-plugin-reloader#card-zh","repo":"deepforce/dsh-plugin-reloader","commit":"7a624c918fe63b843ef9e26ddc678f80f134e0f3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-reloader 是面向 DSH web 的插件热重载插件，通过轮询已加载插件的入口文件和 package.json，在代码变更后清理模块缓存并重新挂载插件。它提供自动检测、/reload 手动重载和 /watch-status 状态查看；依赖树变化时可按配置退出以便 supervisor 重启，重载失败会尝试恢复旧插件。适合需要升级 DSH 插件并减少手动重启的 web 用户。可配置监视范围、轮询与防抖时间以及重载限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:495-601","src/index.ts:620-670"]}
{"unit_id":"deepforce__dsh-plugin-reloader#card-en","repo":"deepforce/dsh-plugin-reloader","commit":"7a624c918fe63b843ef9e26ddc678f80f134e0f3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-reloader hot-reloads installed DSH web plugins by polling entry files and remounting changes. Use /reload for manual reload and /watch-status for diagnostics. Dependency changes can signal an external supervisor to restart DSH; failed reloads attempt to restore the prior plugin.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:495-601","src/index.ts:620-670"]}
